13. Semantic Axial Compression

Vivisection should alternate between transformation and stabilization.

X_k
\xrightarrow{Rotor}
X'_k
\xrightarrow{Stator}
X_{k+1}

Rotor

Create useful variation.

* analogy
* inversion
* decomposition
* perspective change
* abstraction
* recombination
* adversarial attack
* Indigo Hammer

Stator

Prevent semantic explosion.

* restore invariants
* merge duplicates
* discard irrelevant branches
* type discoveries
* preserve distinctions
* create handles
* test against objective

Repeat:

R-S-R-S-R-S

until additional rotation produces insufficient useful delta.

This is not merely compression.

It is semantic turbine compression.

Transformation creates pressure.

Stabilization directs it.

