15. EXERCISE

Now the capability must leave the museum.

\boxed{
EXERCISE(Capability,Target,Context)
}

Exercise means several things simultaneously:

* use a capability,
* train a capability,
* test a capability,
* exercise judgment,
* exercise authority,
* conduct a rehearsal before consequence matters.

This makes exercise Pantheon’s bridge between possession and action.

\text{KNOWN}
<
\text{RECONSTRUCTABLE}
<
\text{AVAILABLE}
<
\boxed{\text{EXERCISED}}
<
\text{DEMONSTRATED}

A capability that has never been exercised remains a capability claim.

