32. The Critical Distinction

Pantheon does not require:

\text{everything}
\rightarrow
\text{code}

Pantheon requires:

\boxed{
\text{everything worth keeping}
\rightarrow
\text{reconstructable capability}
}

Some capabilities will eventually become Python.

Some JavaScript.

Some prompts.

Some model policies.

Some schemas.

Some human procedures.

Some interfaces.

Some may remain vivid natural-language objects because that representation produces the highest reconstruction fidelity.

Implementation is a phenotype.

The operator is the inheritance.

